  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_1881.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La Asociaci&oacute;n Rellamp, que agrupa a los conjuntos musicales de Onda, ha abierto las puertas otra jornada este s&aacute;bado de su nave 7 de la calle San Fernando y ha acogido los conciertos de 1.000 Excusas e Impass.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1871.jpg\" alt=\"img_1871\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1872.jpg\" alt=\"img_1872\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1873.jpg\" alt=\"img_1873\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1874.jpg\" alt=\"img_1874\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1875.jpg\" alt=\"img_1875\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1876.jpg\" alt=\"img_1876\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1877.jpg\" alt=\"img_1877\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1878.jpg\" alt=\"img_1878\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsrellampmilescusasiimpass/img_1879.jpg\" alt=\"img_1879\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\